      "message": "`MAX_SB_SQUARE` is 128 * 128 \u003d 16 KB. So these two arrays add up to 48 KB. Since we use only one of them, please see if we can use a union to save 16 KB on the stack:\n\n```\n  union {\n    DECLARE_ALIGNED(16, uint16_t, dclevel16[MAX_SB_SQUARE]);\n    DECLARE_ALIGNED(16, uint8_t, dclevel8[MAX_SB_SQUARE]);\n  } u;\n```\n\nAnd then use `u.dclevel16` and `u.dclevel8` below.",
